    "detailed_description": "Are you ready for an endless adventure? In Shadows Behind, you embark on a challenging journey as a knight searching for magical orbs. These orbs are crucial for protecting your kingdom. However, throughout your journey, you are being pursued by your own dark shadow versions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOrb Collection: Every magical orb you encounter along the way rewards you with points. Collect these orbs to achieve high scores.<br />\r\nAvoiding Shadows: Your shadows track every step you take and develop various strategies to capture you. You need to stay clear of these shadows while overcoming obstacles and avoiding rapidly moving dangers.<br />\r\nChallenging Obstacles: You will face various obstacles during your journey. These obstacles test your reflexes and strategic thinking. You must navigate around these obstacles while avoiding the shadows.<br />\r\nTips for Success:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStrategy and Reflexes: Be careful with every move and adjust your strategy accordingly. To survive among rapidly moving dangers and shadows, you need to think quickly and make the right moves.",
